  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peanut Paste Expansion and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mangalla Women Development Association will use grant funding to construct a multipurpose storage facility to reduce post-harvest losses, purchase a modern processing oil expeller to improve efficiency and quality, purchase a truck to facilitate transport of peanut paste and oil to market, and purchase raw peanuts from its farmer members.</narrative>
  </description>
